# SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-4.0
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Fairflow, please cite the software and the blueprint below. The research design rests on the three source studies listed under references."
type: software
title: "Fairflow: a serious game of distributive justice in water allocation"
abstract: >
  Fairflow is a phone-first progressive web app in which three to five water users and a
  basin authority share a river and an aquifer over five or six seasons, vote each season on
  the principle of distributive justice that decides the split, act privately on what they
  receive, and are scored together on equity, efficiency and sustainability. It is the
  serious-game entry point of the EquiNex Spatial Equity Modeling Suite.
